<title>USA: Class action suit filed vs FORE Systems.</title>
<headline>Class action suit filed vs FORE Systems.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lawyers representing plaintiffs against FORE Systems Inc said they have filed a class action lawsuit alleging the company made false statements about its operations which artificially inflated the stock.</p>
<p>Fore Systems issued a statement saying it believed the allegations were without merit and saying it plans to &quot;vigorously&quot; defend itself.</p>
<p>Filed in the Western District of Pennsylvania, the suit covers purchases of FORE Systems stock of Oct 17, 1996 through April 1, 1997, the lawyers said in a statement.</p>
